"interpretation\":\"Props describe supported seams, not a guarantee that all requested behavior is implemented. Nested type text may be abbreviated. Prefer application props/composition; if a required seam is absent, explain the gap before proposing implementation takeover. Do not trace Host Runtime to infer missing public APIs.\"},\"documentation\":{\"status\":\"available\",\"referenceOnly\":true,\"creatorVersion\":\"0.0.1\",\"entries\":[{\"documentId\":\"public:development/react-host-api\",\"title\":\"React 页面参数与方法\",\"source\":\"public\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/react-host-api\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s48\",\"title\":\"运行上下文回调\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/react-host-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s48\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s75\",\"title\":\"输入参数结构\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/react-host-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s75\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"title\":\"插件开发接口\",\"source\":\"public\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s441\",\"title\":\"主题与多语言\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s441\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s125\",\"title\":\"会话操作与实例信息\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s125\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"internal:architecture/transient-assistant-messages\",\"title\":\"Transient conversation messages\",\"source\":\"internal\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"internal:architecture/transient-assistant-messages\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s44\",\"title\":\"Display plugin and lifetime\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"internal:architecture/transient-assistant-messages\",\"sectionId\":\"s44\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s8\",\"title\":\"Calling from a Host\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"internal:architecture/transient-assistant-messages\",\"sectionId\":\"s8\"}}}]}],\"interpretation\":\"Versioned documentation navigation, not source reads, installed target API facts or permission. Read relevant sections on demand; ordinary coding and inspection remain available.\"}},\"coverage\":{\"sourcesComplete\":true,\"sourceReadCount\":4,\"fileNavigation\":[{\"path\":\"src/agent-ui/plugins/context-retrieval-message/index.tsx\",\"role\":\"entry\",\"status\":\"read\"},{\"role\":\"module\",\"from\":\"src/agent-ui/plugins/context-retrieval-message/index.tsx\",\"specifier\":\"@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins/context-retrieval-message\",\"status\":\"external\"},{\"role\":\"module\",\"from\":\"src/agent-ui/plugins/context-retrieval-message/index.tsx\",\"specifier\":\"react\",\"status\":\"external\"},{\"path\":\"src/agent-ui/plugins/context-retrieval-message/definition.ts\",\"role\":\"definition\",\"status\":\"read\"},{\"role\":\"module\",\"from\":\"src/agent-ui/plugins/context-retrieval-message/definition.ts\",\"specifier\":\"@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins\",\"status\":\"external\"},{\"role\":\"module\",\"from\":\"src/agent-ui/plugins/context-retrieval-message/definition.ts\",\"specifier\":\"@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins/context-retrieval-message\",\"status\":\"external\"},{\"path\":\"src/agent-ui/plugins/context-retrieval-message/manifest.json\",\"role\":\"manifest\",\"status\":\"read\"},{\"path\":\"src/agent-ui/plugins/context-retrieval-message/application.json\",\"role\":\"application_metadata\",\"status\":\"read\"}],\"interpretation\":\"Source pages are bounded. Follow nextRead for unread/truncated files. Only literal relative imports were followed; package imports and aliases remain navigation, not an assertion of a complete dependency graph.\"},\"interpretation\":\"Returned source files are fresh read evidence in this run. Definition/manifest, services, instances and parents describe the actual Plugin, including custom project Plugins. References preserve available installed API and shared types; unknown/omitted detail is not evidence of an unsupported feature. Read relevant documentation sections on demand. This read grants no write/development/takeover authority. Application edits affect all instances using that application; use composition inspection for layout/instance changes.\"}}","role":"tool"}

