ic types and package-owned presentation contracts, not mutation authority. Queries: export.member; $parameter0 through $parameter9 for invocation props; $return for callable return; $element for array/index values; returned $variant0 through $variant7 paths for union branches. Types establish signatures, not runtime semantics; missing behavior facts must remain unverified. Unresolved queries and omitted details are explicit. Each presentation contract is returned once per root export in this response.\"},\"projection\":{\"kind\":\"installed_public_api\",\"referenceOnly\":true,\"pluginDetails\":{\"tool\":\"inspect_ui_plugin\",\"input\":{\"pluginId\":\"context-retrieval-message\"}},\"guidance\":\"API signatures only. For a large exported type, query the required export.member instead of reading all domains. This query does not select an editing target or grant source ownership.\"}}}","role":"tool"}

